      "message": "If the Go process gets cancelled/killed while running, is it possible for it to leave intermediate files in its destination?\n\nI imagine that instead of creating OutDir()/multiproduct-xxxx, and deleting it when done, we would create OutDir()/multiproduct, and would delete it both before the build starts (just in case) and also when it completes.",
